    "about_the_game": "Chrono Mirror is an action/adventure 2D platformer that takes heavy inspiration from the Mega Man Zero series as well as the Azure Striker Gunvolt series.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544220/extras/bead5cd9e18571be852b8cb13dd7602c.avif?t=1725391788\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A TEAM</strong></h2><br>Build a team of two from a potential pool of over 20 playable characters, switching between either character throughout each mission. The success and difficulty of each mission is determined by how well your team is able to deal with the various environments, enemies, and bosses in the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544220/extras/f80fbb66dc1ab5c8fbc29d305abfd58d.poster.avif?t=1725391788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544220/extras/f80fbb66dc1ab5c8fbc29d305abfd58d.webm?t=1725391788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544220/extras/841ec51fa4bf598c239e1cd17a521e8e.poster.avif?t=1725391788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544220/extras/841ec51fa4bf598c239e1cd17a521e8e.webm?t=1725391788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544220/extras/417199854c443409c32ef5473bf4d429.poster.avif?t=1725391788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app